# Flask Backend Integration Guide

This guide contains all the JavaScript updates needed to integrate your frontend with the Flask backend API.

---

## 📋 Overview

Your Flask backend is running at `http://localhost:5000` with these endpoints:
- **POST** `/api/predict` - Returns tumor prediction
- **GET** `/api/health` - Health check

The backend returns JSON like:
```json
{
  "success": true,
  "predicted_class": "glioma",
  "confidence_percentage": 92.41,
  "all_probabilities": {
    "glioma": 92.41,
    "meningioma": 5.23,
    "pituitary": 1.89,
    "notumor": 0.47
  }
}
```

---

## 🔧 Implementation Changes

### 1. Update [patient-upload.html](file:///c:/Users/PMLS/Desktop/ui%20ph1/patient-upload.html)

**Location:** Lines 292-308 (inside the existing `<script>` tag)

**Replace the existing "Analyze scan" button click handler** (lines 293-308) with:

```javascript
// Analyze scan - UPDATED TO USE REAL BACKEND
analyzeBtn.addEventListener('click', async function () {
    if (!uploadedFile) return;

    // Hide upload area and show loading
    uploadArea.style.display = 'none';
    previewArea.classList.add('d-none');
    analyzeBtn.classList.add('d-none');
    clearBtn.classList.add('d-none');
    loadingOverlay.classList.remove('d-none');

    try {
        // Create FormData and append the image file
        const formData = new FormData();
        formData.append('file', uploadedFile);

        // Send POST request to Flask backend
        const response = await fetch('http://localhost:5000/api/predict', {
            method: 'POST',
            body: formData
        });

        if (!response.ok) {
            throw new Error(`HTTP error! status: ${response.status}`);
        }

        const result = await response.json();

        if (result.success) {
            // Store prediction results in sessionStorage
            sessionStorage.setItem('predictedClass', result.predicted_class);
            sessionStorage.setItem('confidence', result.confidence_percentage.toFixed(2));
            sessionStorage.setItem('probabilities', JSON.stringify(result.all_probabilities));
            
            // uploadedImage is already stored in handleFile function (line 268)
            // Redirect to results page after short delay
            setTimeout(function () {
                window.location.href = 'patient-results-new.html';
            }, 500);
        } else {
            throw new Error('Prediction failed: ' + (result.error || 'Unknown error'));
        }
    } catch (error) {
        console.error('Error during prediction:', error);
        
        // Hide loading overlay
        loadingOverlay.classList.add('d-none');
        
        // Show upload area again
        uploadArea.style.display = '';
        previewArea.classList.remove('d-none');
        analyzeBtn.classList.remove('d-none');
        clearBtn.classList.remove('d-none');
        
        // Show error message
        showAlert('Failed to analyze scan. Please ensure the backend server is running at http://localhost:5000 and try again. Error: ' + error.message, 'danger');
    }
});
```

